# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Vision runtime assets — both are fetched, not authored.
# public/mediapipe/wasm/ is 33.8 MB copied verbatim out of node_modules by
# `postinstall`; committing it would version the same bytes twice and let it
# drift from the installed @mediapipe/tasks-vision.
# public/models/*.task is the 3.7 MB MediaPipe face_landmarker download.
# Restore both with:  npm install && npm run fetch:model
public/mediapipe/
public/models/*.task

